{
  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 基础设施投资激增，地缘政治风险下的市场版图重构 / Global AI Infra Investment Surges Amidst Geopolitical Realignment",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球资讯聚焦三大趋势：科技领域，AI Agent 从理论转向企业知识库集成与工程实践，尽管增长预期理性，但基础设施投入依然巨大；财经领域，资本正流向 AI 产业链核心地区，台湾市场超越韩国表现抢眼，同时卡塔尔能源获中国银行巨额贷款，显示出跨区域的金融协作；时政方面，法国校园抗议频发，苏丹与也门地区冲突加剧，国际局势的不确定性持续影响能源与供应链稳定。在全球经济深度联动的背景下，技术进步与区域政治风险成为左右资产配置的关键变量。\n\nGlobal updates highlight three key shifts: In tech, AI agents are moving from theoretical research to enterprise knowledge integration and engineering practice, with massive investments in infrastructure continuing despite tempered long-term expectations. Financially, capital is flowing into the AI supply chain's core, with Taiwan outperforming Korea; notably, QatarEnergy secured a $3 billion loan from Chinese banks, underscoring inter-regional financial cooperation. Geopolitically, protests in France and escalations in Sudan and Yemen threaten energy and supply chain stability, as global interdependence makes technological gains and regional volatility the dual forces shaping asset allocation.",
  "tech_briefs": [
    {
      "title": "LLM 上下文溢出的工程化解决策略 / Engineering Strategies for LLM Context Eviction",
      "url": "https://juejin.cn/post/7693225151681757194",
      "source": "掘金",
      "summary": "针对大模型上下文窗口满载问题，文章对比了五种生产环境下的淘汰策略，强调从「被动崩溃」转向「主动管理」对 Agent 稳定性至关重要。\n\nThis post compares five production-grade context eviction strategies for LLMs, emphasizing the necessity of shifting from reactive crashes to proactive management for Agent stability.",
      "importance": 8
    },
    {
      "title": "企业 AI Agent 的知识连接挑战 / Connecting AI Agents to Enterprise Knowledge",
      "url": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/05/1145580/connecting-ai-agents-to-enterprise-knowledge/",
      "source": "MIT Tech Review AI",
      "summary": "AI Agent 在企业端面临的最大瓶颈并非数据匮乏，而是缺乏理解业务逻辑的「知识」，如何弥合数据与决策之间的鸿沟是行业痛点。\n\nThe main bottleneck for enterprise AI agents isn't a lack of data, but a lack of knowledge to understand business logic; bridging the gap between data and decision-making is a critical industry hurdle.",
      "importance": 9
    },
    {
      "title": "AI 对就业影响的十年预测 / AI Won't Take Your Job Anytime Soon",
      "url": "https://x.com/mustafasuleyman/status/2107475087075197239",
      "source": "X 推文 (AttentionVC)",
      "summary": "诺贝尔奖得主预测，未来十年 AI 仅能替代约 5% 的人类工作内容，呼吁理性看待 AI 对就业市场的长期冲击。\n\nNobel laureate predicts that AI will only replace about 5% of human work in the next decade, calling for a rational perspective on AI's long-term impact on the job market.",
