  "editor_note": "AI 正在从「玩具」进化为「工程难题」。当各行业巨头押注算力基建时，普通人应关注如何在这一进程中，通过提升 AI 工具治理能力来构建自身的护城河。\n\nAI is evolving from a \"toy\" into an \"engineering challenge.\" As giants bet on infrastructure, individuals must focus on building their \"moat\" by mastering AI tool governance.",
